    {
      "label": {
        "en": [
          "Alternative Text"
        ]
      },
      "value": {
        "en": [
          "A painting made up of vibrant brushstrokes showing the inside of a café with a billiards table at center and tables and chairs lining the walls. The ceiling is green, the walls are red, and the floor is yellowish-brown. Four lamps suspended from the ceiling radiate light in the form of short brushstrokes. A man stands near the billiards table with hands in his pockets. A few people sit at some tables, and a small bar stands at the back.  "
        ]
      }
    }
